# Allowlist for scripts/check_substrate_stubs.sh.
#
# Format:
#   <MarkerName-or-consideration-string> <ticket-id>     # Audit 1 / 2
#   STUB:<file>:<line>:<dse_name>        <ticket-id>     # Audit 3 — plan-template stub
#
# Comments: everything after `#` is ignored.
#
# Each entry MUST cite the ticket that wires the marker (Audit 1),
# fixes the consideration reference (Audit 2), or lands the named
# successor entity for a plan-template stub (Audit 3). When the work
# lands, drop the entry; the lint will then enforce that the substrate
# stays wired. Adding a new entry without a ticket id is a code-review
# failure.
#
# Catalogue: docs/open-work/pre-existing/substrate-stub-catalogue.md

HideEligible 170           # Hide-authoring system (extends ticket 104's Phase 1 dormancy)
STUB:src/ai/planner/actions.rs:330:trashing 200    # Trashing routes through Wilds until PlannerZone::Midden lands (ticket 200) — line shifted by 035's burying_actions() insertion + 364's htn_primitive_actions() insertion

# 322: Action-enum dormant stubs for the 128 HTN-methods epic Tier-2
# methods. Each placeholder step resolver in `src/steps/disposition/`
# returns `StepResult::Fail` and is never invoked at runtime (the
# corresponding HTN method is registered as PendingSubstrate, so
# `MethodRegistry::lookup` filters it out). Documentation-only
# convention per `docs/systems/htn-methods.md` §G / Action-enum stubs
# — `check_substrate_stubs.sh` does not currently audit resolver
# symbol names, so these entries anchor the dormant→wiring
# relationship for grep / similar-search / code-review rather than
# gating CI. Drop each entry when the named ticket lands.
resolve_wear_item             334   # acquire_stealth_via_{self_craft,commission} don-gear sub-goal
resolve_craft                 334   # acquire_stealth_via_self_craft crafting sub-goal
resolve_petition_coordinator  334   # acquire_stealth_via_commission petition sub-goal
resolve_vigil                 332   # mourn_at_grave vigil-at-grave sub-goal
resolve_grief_sit             332   # mourn_at_grave grieve-in-den sub-goal
